WEBVTT

00:06.720 --> 00:07.800
Her then

00:07.880 --> 00:09.280
Yes

00:09.360 --> 00:10.120
Proceed

00:10.200 --> 00:12.280
To Talent Liu's palace

00:30.200 --> 00:31.960
Your Majesty only drinks

00:32.200 --> 00:34.360
Don't you feel hungry?

00:35.280 --> 00:36.680
Hungry

00:37.120 --> 00:38.040
I

00:38.120 --> 00:39.520
Am indeed hungry

00:42.200 --> 00:44.760
A foreign beauty entered the palace recently

00:45.400 --> 00:47.200
I have already trained her

00:47.640 --> 00:49.400
Waiting for today to enter the palace

00:49.480 --> 00:52.360
To serve Your Majesty together with me

00:53.000 --> 00:54.400
Good

00:56.160 --> 00:57.560
Ya'er

00:57.640 --> 00:59.973
Come in and let Your Majesty see

01:09.480 --> 01:10.960
Sister often tells me

01:11.120 --> 01:13.680
She loves most the look in Your Majesty's eyes when you gaze at her

01:13.760 --> 01:15.160
Like a wolf

01:31.040 --> 01:32.440
Wolf

01:35.400 --> 01:37.400
Your Majesty may not yet know

01:37.560 --> 01:39.720
The wonders of my sister Ya'er

01:40.440 --> 01:41.640
Our branch

01:41.720 --> 01:44.680
Is most skilled at taming fierce wolves

01:46.480 --> 01:47.240
It seems

01:47.360 --> 01:49.640
This foreign beauty I carefully selected

01:49.760 --> 01:51.160
Is indeed different

01:51.720 --> 01:53.400
Makes Your Majesty

01:54.280 --> 01:56.720
Too busy to even look at me

01:58.800 --> 02:00.400
The talent has given me

02:00.480 --> 02:01.720
A trained person

02:01.800 --> 02:04.000
I will remember your merit

02:16.000 --> 02:17.400
Good

